* text=auto
*.dll binary
*.cur binary
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
# Keep payload bytes identical to manifest hashes, including GitHub ZIP downloads.
payload/** -text
*.pdn binary
# Preserve upstream payload formatting without flagging its unchanged CRLF/spacing.
payload/** whitespace=cr-at-eol,-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof
